                <note rend="inline" type="source">834.01/19: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-03-07T11:00:00-03:00">March 7, 1936—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 7—10:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>91. My 85, March 2, 7 p.m. Have been informed in strictest confidence by the
                    Italian Ambassador that his Government has instructed the Italian Minister at
                    Asunción to say that recogition will be withheld until after favorable action by
                    mediatory powers.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gibson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
